# Frontend Environment Variables for Production
# REACT_APP_API_URL is optionally set here.
# If not set, the app falls back to '/api' (relative path) which works
# automatically on Vercel since frontend and backend share the same domain.
#
# To use a custom backend URL, set REACT_APP_API_URL in Vercel Dashboard:
#   Settings → Environment Variables → Add
#   Name: REACT_APP_API_URL
#   Value: https://your-app-name.vercel.app/api
#   Environments: Production, Preview, Development
